3
00:00:03,195 --> 00:00:04,511
Papan skornya sampai menyerah.

4
00:00:04,851 --> 00:00:06,383
Ini AUDIRA.

5
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:09,262
Wimbledon, Juni dua ribu sepuluh,

6
00:00:09,602 --> 00:00:10,825
Lapangan delapan belas.

7
00:00:11,165 --> 00:00:13,410
John Isner, unggulan dua puluh tiga

8
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:15,902
dari Amerika, melawan Nicolas Mahut,

9
00:00:16,242 --> 00:00:18,053
pemain kualifikasi dari Prancis.

10
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:20,266
Saat itu set kelima Wimbledon belum

11
00:00:20,266 --> 00:00:22,169
mengenal tie-break. Pemenangnya harus

12
00:00:22,169 --> 00:00:22,943
unggul dua game.

13
00:00:23,393 --> 00:00:25,203
Hari pertama, gelap menghentikan

14
00:00:25,203 --> 00:00:26,534
laga. Hari kedua,

15
00:00:26,874 --> 00:00:28,035
