16
00:00:28,345 --> 00:00:30,140
dan tak ada yang bisa mematahkan

17
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,982
servis lawan. Di empat puluh tujuh

18
00:00:31,982 --> 00:00:33,963
sama, papan skor elektronik di

19
00:00:33,963 --> 00:00:34,985
